<title>GERMANY: Buba revises German June industry output upward.</title>
<headline>Buba revises German June industry output upward.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	Jun 96	   May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.7 (+0.6)    +0.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -0.8 (-1.1)    -2.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.5 (98.4)    97.8</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.3 (+0.4)    +0.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   -1.0 (-1.0)    -2.5</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    95.1 (95.2)    94.8</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +2.9 (+1.8)    +0.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +5.3 (+3.4)    -0.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   146.3 (144.7)  142.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
